==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s (600%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Le'boin]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**3 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

